"P2658696127" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor black>I got that ID tag scanned in 5 seconds before you took that guy down. Well, more like a second after you took him down. But you get the idea, I'm fast at doing this."
